Fabrikam, Inc. must archive a report of every Copilot CLI session in a repository when the session finishes. You create the following file in the .github/hooks folder.

```json
{
  "version": [[1]],
  "hooks": {
    "[[2]]": [
      {
        "type": "[[3]]",
        "bash": "./scripts/archive-report.sh",
        "timeoutSec": 60
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

How should you complete the configuration? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.
